.TH GO-MCP-TRANSPORT 7 "2026-04-10" "go-mcp 0.0.9" "Go MCP Framework"
.SH NAME
go-mcp-transport \- transport layer for JSON-RPC messages
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
import "github.com/amarbel-llc/purse-first/libs/go-mcp/transport"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B transport
package defines the interface for sending and receiving JSON-RPC
messages, and provides a stdio implementation using newline-delimited
JSON (not Content-Length headers like LSP).
.SH TYPES
.SS Transport Interface
.nf
type Transport interface {
    Read() (*jsonrpc.Message, error)  // io.EOF on close
    Write(*jsonrpc.Message) error
    Close() error
}
.fi
.SS Stdio
MCP stdio transport using newline-delimited JSON.
.nf
func NewStdio(r io.Reader, w io.Writer) *Stdio
func NewStdioWithCloser(r io.Reader, w io.Writer,
    c io.Closer) *Stdio
.fi
.PP
Buffer: 64KB initial, 1MB max per message.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR go-mcp (7),
.BR go-mcp-server (7)
